   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> GeneratePrivateKey <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Cryptography.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CRYPT_20722\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Cryptography.pdf)\">[SWS_CRYPT_20722]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf#nameddest=RS_CRYPTO_02003\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf)\">RS_CRYPTO_02003</a>, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf#nameddest=RS_CRYPTO_02101\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf)\">RS_CRYPTO_02101</a>, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf#nameddest=RS_CRYPTO_02102\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf)\">RS_CRYPTO_02102</a>, RS_ CRYPTO_02107, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf#nameddest=RS_CRYPTO_02108\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf)\">RS_CRYPTO_02108</a>, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf#nameddest=RS_CRYPTO_02111\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf)\">RS_CRYPTO_02111</a>, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf#nameddest=RS_CRYPTO_02115\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_Cryptography.pdf)\">RS_CRYPTO_02115</a></span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">virtual <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Result_d51722.html\">ara::core::Result</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_crypto_cryp_PrivateKey_a661f0.html\">PrivateKey</a>::<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_crypto_cryp_CryptoProvider_4d0caf.html#SWS_CRYPT_20701\">Sptr</a> &gt; GeneratePrivateKey (Alg Id algId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../namespaces/ns_crypto_ara_crypto_aacf86.html#SWS_CRYPT_10015\">AllowedUsageFlags</a> privateKeyAllowedUsage) noexcept=0;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Generate a new public/private key pair and return the private key. The public key can be retrieved via the function PrivateKey::GetPublicKey() The allowed usage flags of the Public Key are set based on the allowed usage of the PrivateKey: • kAllowDataDecryption --&gt; kAllowDataEncryption • kAllowSigGeneration --&gt; kAllowSigVerification • kAllowKeyAgreement --&gt; kAllowKeyAgreement • kAllowKeyUnwrapping --&gt; kAllowKeyWrapping Additionally, the allowed usage: • kAllowPlaintextExport • kAllowPersist are set for the public key.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
